{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Similar to &quot;Stronghold Kingdoms&quot; but as a single player game in a fantasy setting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Cube Kingdoms&quot; you dive into a captivating medieval fantasy world in which you take on the role of an aspiring ruler of a small village. Your task is to expand your kingdom, defend yourself from enemy attacks, build a powerful army and meet the needs of your people while defying the challenges of the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the leader of the village, you start out with just a few resources and a handful of loyal subjects. Your first step is to develop your village by constructing new buildings, mining resources, researching and building production facilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Cube Kingdoms is fraught with danger, and rival rulers and bandits await every opportunity to attack your kingdom. Therefore, building a powerful army to protect your borders is imperative. Recruit and train brave units to strengthen your defenses and repel attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to military power, meeting the needs of your population is also important to ensure their happiness and contentment. Build residential buildings, improve the quality of life of your subjects and ensure sufficient food and resources. The happier your population is, the more productive they will be and help you with your goals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>The village:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you build up your economy, i.e. lumberjacks, stonemasons, mills and also weapon production. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These buildings cannot be destroyed by an attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483130/extras/a0c1b2d68cff2660a9f1b6437ed25682.avif?t=1767094900\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>The Castle:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the castle you build up your defenses, if an opponent attacks you he has to go through the walls and military units that you place here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These buildings can be destroyed and if the enemy gets into your castle they will rob you or in the worst case take over/destroy your castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483130/extras/7c3e0cf9799c5924fd1374d64cb3faa8.avif?t=1767094900\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>The Overworld:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you can see your neighbors, collect resource nodes and trade. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483130/extras/01458d90c20cfc13e893d17f9e521354.avif?t=1767094900\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a player, you can create your own flag and choose the color of your castle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2483130?t=1767094900","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2483130?t=1767094900","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483130/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767094900","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483130/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767094900","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2484770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Similar to &quot;Stronghold Kingdoms&quot; but as a single player game in a fantasy setting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Cube Kingdoms&quot; you dive into a captivating medieval fantasy world in which you take on the role of an aspiring ruler of a small village. Your task is to expand your kingdom, defend yourself from enemy attacks, build a powerful army and meet the needs of your people while defying the challenges of the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the leader of the village, you start out with just a few resources and a handful of loyal subjects. Your first step is to develop your village by constructing new buildings, mining resources, researching and building production facilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Cube Kingdoms is fraught with danger, and rival rulers and bandits await every opportunity to attack your kingdom. Therefore, building a powerful army to protect your borders is imperative. Recruit and train brave units to strengthen your defenses and repel attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to military power, meeting the needs of your population is also important to ensure their happiness and contentment. Build residential buildings, improve the quality of life of your subjects and ensure sufficient food and resources. The happier your population is, the more productive they will be and help you with your goals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>The village:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you build up your economy, i.e. lumberjacks, stonemasons, mills and also weapon production. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These buildings cannot be destroyed by an attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483130/extras/a0c1b2d68cff2660a9f1b6437ed25682.avif?t=1767094900\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>The Castle:</u></p><p class=\"b